  "recipeCuisine": "Italy",
  "name": "Prawn & Basil Ravioli in a Tomato Sauce",
  "text": "Prawn & Basil Ravioli in a Tomato Sauce\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\nFor the ravioli\n\n500g pasta dough,\n\n275g raw peeled prawns,\n\n10 basil leaves (chopped),\n\n1 handful breadcrumbs,\n\n1 medium egg,\n\nZest of 1/2 unwaxed lemon,\n\nFor the sauce\n\n6 tomatoes (halved accross the middle),\n\n1 bunch watercress (roughly chopped),\n\n2 garlic cloves (whole, in their skin),\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Put the tomatoes in a roasting tin. Drizzle with olive oil, and roast for 40 minutes at gas 1/140C.\n\n2. After 30 mins add the garlic.\n\n3. Push the tomatoes through a sieve into a pan, squeeze in the garlic, discarding the skin. Add the watercress.\n\n4. Mix the prawns, basil leaves, breadcrumbs, egg, and lemon zest and fill the ravioli.\n\n5. Boil the ravioli for 4 minutes.\n\n6. Warm through the sauce, adding a little cream at the end.\n\n7. Season the sauce and serve.",
  "recipeYield": "4",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "For the ravioli",
    "500g pasta dough,",
    "275g raw peeled prawns,",
    "10 basil leaves (chopped),",
    "1 handful breadcrumbs,",
    "1 medium egg,",
    "Zest of 1/2 unwaxed lemon,",
    "For the sauce",
    "6 tomatoes (halved accross the middle),",
    "1 bunch watercress (roughly chopped),",
    "2 garlic cloves (whole, in their skin),"
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "1. Put the tomatoes in a roasting tin. Drizzle with olive oil, and roast for 40 minutes at gas 1/140C."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. After 30 mins add the garlic."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Push the tomatoes through a sieve into a pan, squeeze in the garlic, discarding the skin. Add the watercress."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Mix the prawns, basil leaves, breadcrumbs, egg, and lemon zest and fill the ravioli."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "5. Boil the ravioli for 4 minutes."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "6. Warm through the sauce, adding a little cream at the end."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "7. Season the sauce and serve."
    }
